cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this framework or pilot, please cite it as below."
title: "Testing the Continuous Perceptual Trajectory Hypothesis for Musical Motion: A Preregistered Protocol and Open Framework"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Feng"
    given-names: "Yuhan"
    email: "fengru@gmail.com"
abstract: >-
  A preregistered protocol, framework, and open-source pilot for testing whether
  musical motion can be represented as a continuous latent perceptual trajectory.
  Transformation semantics are established by human ratings at the
  (transform, parameter) level before any representation is evaluated.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Fengrru/mmt"
url: "https://github.com/Fengrru/mmt"
version: "0.0.1"
date-released: "2026-09-13"
keywords:
  - music information retrieval
  - representation learning
  - self-supervised learning
  - perceptual similarity
  - preregistration
